ave two identical private `fiscalYearOf` methods in the model and the controller.\n\nMinor (not blocking on its own): `getFiscalYear()` and `getLocality()` both hardcode the fixed-suffix arithmetic (`length() - 11`, `- 9`, `< 12`) to slice FY/REGION out of the base. The magic `11` (= FY 2 + HASH8 8 + CHK 1) is repeated with slightly different guards in the two readers; a single named constant or a small `memberIdSegments()` helper would make the format contract one place rather than scattered offsets."
